# Git workflow (hermes-stack)

Follow **[docs/GIT.md](../../docs/GIT.md)** as the source of truth.

## Branches

- `main` → `develop` → `feature/<layer>/<slug>`
- Branch features from **develop**, never commit feature work on `main`
- Layer path examples: `zalo`, `memory`, `session`, `worker`, `gateway`, `arch`, `hermes`, `docs`

## PR / commit title (required)

```text
[<BRANCH_KIND>][<LAYER>][<CHANGE_TYPE>] <Imperative summary>
```

Example: `[FEATURE][ZALO][FIX] Prevent Hermes restart storm from watch timers`

## Must

- Update `docs/CHANGELOG.md` (top entry + timestamp) for ops/product changes
- PR base = `develop`
- Push only when GitHub auth is the repo owner (`7ringuy4n` for this repo)
- No VPS/remote apply without explicit permission
- Force-push / amend only when the operator explicitly asks (`--force-with-lease`)
- Do not commit `.env`, secrets, or `scripts/temp/**` / `hermes/temp/**` drafts
